27806617", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1468113317689105", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393901_1468113321022438_5301992700359513093_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SpST7ReATd0Q7kNvwEuWzpH&_nc_oc=Adq3vGUPYzitG_AAlD2S83Lnj_qwXRu25aMEAmuu82waIhONTGMjvAEqAFDfc0pv3Q4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwMPcE82zBLUAj7PuvW7K-AVAnQsF7UjSFF0ZTlyQUGkQ&oe=69C125C6"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1183010303571395", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393491_1183010306904728_6851860163469096445_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7DZ2X8149QoQ7kNvwEI9B_b&_nc_oc=AdpIdv7rbLpxyYwKbaVz9WMsJLBrdkIpLcne1CGM8y0dQfdpXbX7OOQve-A88ty4gVw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzW1kB0405nyn4JiPgvketMCCo-A5N61-UmoqGnE4QZ-g&oe=69C122A3"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1358340778764461", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473402211_1358340782097794_7615245122570796576_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bl2oGG8l7B0Q7kNvwEMV2TK&_nc_oc=AdqT615rywMsFSnWfhkBwVdGcpyFFyl_gAxCGSBrdDzanM13mgRxMUrjiGe5L8DwX5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxM7XokKw_Tcq8FNqZ4EPZyCY1a7drdJ6FfjyD5INIxgQ&oe=69C1396B"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1023722979911327", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824623_1023722983244660_6615002093131769634_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QBObRgL4KkcQ7kNvwG25AdY&_nc_oc=AdpwKPuvMeOrmpAVvP10dDIx6iW0z4UJt8nIYIpe1aBBLhVve452wNgxD6dppE97A1U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyKZ0JgMyY1KM8En1S7A0AdHvmInyI5iktu5cZj9uxSTg&oe=69C13E57"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1062837435691242", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392048_1062837442357908_3730609957565045373_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xzcz5-crKIQQ7kNvwHHZNoW&_nc_oc=AdouReYli4SRiPhJuIppLk93GD3zgbqEWCY5upJDoa5hH1Vqr-qQQOQBgn6tQSx4YpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzkTeysE2KnhqF4h0p-aM8TMAmwIpPzkeWtskoWLkTKPg&oe=69C14ED3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car War Vr: RC Stunt Game", "keywords": ["driving", "race", "mini", "drift", "fight"], "long_description": "Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is an action-packed VR racing and combat game that puts you in control of high-powered remote control cars armed to the teeth. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, this single-player experience combines arcade-style racing, vehicle combat, and extreme stunt driving into one adrenaline-fueled package.\nStrap into the cockpit view of your RC war machine and enter explosive arenas filled with jumps, ramps, and AI enemies. Use skill, speed, and strategy to perform jaw-dropping stunts, avoid deadly traps, and blast opponents with powerful weapons like rockets, lasers, and EMPs.\nCustomize your car with a variety of upgrades\u2014boosters, armor, wheels, and weapons\u2014to suit your combat style. Explore unique environments, from backyard battlegrounds to sci-fi stunt zones, each crafted for fast-paced, chaotic fun.\nKey Features:\nImmersive VR racing combat with intuitive controls\n\n\nHigh-speed, physics-driven RC stunt action\n\n\n- Customizable cars with unlockable weapons and gadgets\n- Challenging single-player missions and smart AI opponents\n- Explosive visuals with slow-motion effects and dynamic crashes\n\nExperience the thrill of car battles in VR like never before. Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is the ultimate test of your reflexes, creativity, and combat driving skills.", "short_description": "Race, drift, and stunt in this high-speed RC car VR experience! Build custom tracks, upgrade your ride, and compete solo in action-packed challenges. Designed for Meta Quest, this immersive racing game brings remote control fun to life with realistic physics and endless creativity."}]},